    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Проверка скобок"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "def brackets_ok(s):\n    stack = []\n    pairs = {\")\": \"(\", \"]\": \"[\", \"}\": \"{\"}\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in \"([{\":\n            stack.append(ch)\n        elif ch in \")]}\":\n            if not stack or stack.pop() != pairs[ch]:\n                return False\n    return not stack\n\nbrackets_ok(\"([{}])\")  # True\nbrackets_ok(\"([)]\")    # False\n```"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Очередь (FIFO) — deque"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "BFS (поиск в ширину)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "def bfs(graph, start):\n    visited = set()\n    queue = deque([start])\n    while queue:\n        node = queue.popleft()\n        if node not in visited:\n            visited.add(node)\n            queue.extend(graph[node] - visited)\n    return visited\n```"
    },
